  "brief": {
    "prose": "Freeport Commons is the Registry's oldest working ground, five kilometres north of the Freeport on the floor of Occator: open to anyone the Registry licenses, staked by nobody, and worked over since the Outbound opened the Belt, so every block has given up a share of what it held. The pad is a cleared square of fused regolith with the Freeport's lights on the southern horizon."
